Summary:
This won't be a "Have you heard about ChatGPT?" kind of talk. We assume you've already tried services like ChatGPT, Claude, or Gemini. Here, we’ll strip away the jargon and hype to focus on how generative AI can make a tangible impact. You'll see real-world examples that show the practical, pragmatic side of this cutting-edge technology. This session will provide a clear and engaging overview of how generative AI is reshaping industries and our daily routines. We'll cover: 
1) Finding the right tools for specific use cases;
2) A framework to quickly evaluate competing GenAI services;
3) Integrating generative AI into existing workflows and processes;
4) Combining GenAI services with agents;
5) Ensuring the quality and consistency of generated content.
